          <title>4 CONTRAINDICATIONS</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Warfarin is contraindicated in <content styleCode="bold">pregnancy</content>, except in women with mechanical heart valves.</paragraph>
            <paragraph>Hemorrhagic tendencies or blood dyscrasias.</paragraph>
          </text>
